   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Illustrious pose swap (SDPose + NoobAI OpenPose)\n\nStarter workflow from **Comfortable** (Workflows screen). Every model it uses was installed with it.\n\n1. Load the **pose reference** image (a person in the pose you want; photo or drawing).\n2. Check the skeleton in **Pose preview**, then describe your character in the positive prompt.\n3. Press **Run**. Lower the ControlNet strength (0.6-0.8) to let the model fix anatomy, or end it earlier (0.7) for looser poses. Match the latent's aspect ratio to the reference.\n\n**Models:** SDPose whole-body (core ComfyUI), NoobAI OpenPose ControlNet, WAI-illustrious-SDXL v17"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Illustrious pose swap (SDPose + NoobAI OpenPose)\n\nStarter workflow from **Comfortable** (Workflows screen). Every model it uses was installed with it.\n\n1. Load the **pose reference** image (a person in the pose you want; photo or drawing).\n2. Check the skeleton in **Pose preview**, then describe your character in the positive prompt.\n3. Press **Run**. Lower the ControlNet strength (0.6-0.8) to let the model fix anatomy, or end it earlier (0.7) for looser poses. Match the latent's aspect ratio to the reference.\n\n**Models:** SDPose whole-body (core ComfyUI), NoobAI OpenPose ControlNet, WAI-illustrious-SDXL v17"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
